    "時給を入れると同じ倍率体系で自動計算します。残業・早出は時給×倍率、夜勤・休日系の日額は時給×1日時間×倍率です。": "Enter an hourly rate to calculate using the same multipliers. Overtime and early work use hourly rate times multiplier; night and holiday daily rates use hourly rate times daily hours times multiplier.",
